  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CORE FUNDING TO MISEAN CARA, WHICH PROVIDES GRANTS TO MISSIONARY ORGANISATIONS FOR THEIR DEVELOPMENT WORK IN AFRICA, ASIA AND SOUTH AMERICA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PARTNER: Institute of the Blessed Virgin Mary (Loreto) PROJECT: Aims to provide age-appropriate quality education and essential services to families and children of seasonal migrant workers in brickfields, many of whom belong to India&#x2019;s most marginalised groups. By establishing Brickfield Schools at work sites, the project ensures children can continue their education, acquire foundational skills aligned with government curricula, and reintegrate into formal schools upon returning to their native villages.</narrative>
  </description>
